<!--Post: 7302--><!--Time: 1108386656-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7302"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 14, 2005 - 5:10 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->First save Analyzers maps <BR>&#92;link <a href="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v622/JMTTS/wichita_2.jpg" target=_top>http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v622/JMTTS/wichi ta_2.jpg</a> <BR> <BR>also go through the Carol Mould topic and get his map from there. Print them out. <BR> <BR>On first map start at Vians, draw a straight line to Nancy Fox, then to Anna Williams house, then to the Oterro house, then to Brights, then to Sherry Baker, then back to Vians, then to Vicki W, then over to Thomas B King, then down to Bill Thomas Killman. To me this looks like &#39;b&#39; &#39;T&#39; &#39;k&#39;, missing one point around the intersection of S West St and 400. Do we have a murder/body around there? I dont know. <BR> <BR>Second scenario, including unconfirmed victims, start at Vians, over to Nancy, then to Anna Williams, then to Oteros, then to Kathryn Bright, then to Sherry Baker, back to Vians. Pick up pencil and draw a line from Thomas B King to Bill Thomas Killman, passing through Vians. There is your &#39;b&#39;.  In this scenario I think Vicki is the starting point for the &#39;T&#39;, and I also think Kristi Hatfield and Shannon Olsen are part of the &#39;T&#39;. The &#39;T&#39; needs some more work, I dont have agood mapping program for plotting addresses. <BR>To make the &#39;k&#39;, draw a line from Hedge home, to Davis home, to Mould home. pick up pencil and draw a line from where Mrs Hedge was found, to where Mrs Davis was found. To complete the &#39;k&#39;, we would need to find out if there was a murder/body around 5-10 miles north of Mould home. <BR> <BR>I know its confusing, and very hard to put into words.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
