<!--Post: 7730--><!--Time: 1108667129-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7730"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 11:05 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The Vian House is where the circle of the b meets the leg of the b, the leg of the b is a line drawn from Thomas king to Bill Killman.  <BR> <BR>The leg for the k may be the slanted line from Vian to Nancy, or it could even be from Vian to 1151 S Waverly, &#40;look at possible victims <BR>on this board to see who is at 1151 S Waverly, i dont remember off thetop of my head.&#41; <BR> <BR>I put numbers on each point and also make a key for it, and sent it on to armchairpi. I dont know if he posted it yet. <BR> <BR>Could this map be just a coincidence? Maybe I should take a map, and just randomly put dots on it, and see if I can MAKE it say something. I have been accused of having a very fertile imagination.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7730-->
<!--Post: 7731--><!--Time: 1108667308-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7731"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 11:08 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Analyzer, can you redo my map, using one of yours with name markers. I really feel my map is important, but people cant understand it. <BR>thanks, itty<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7731-->
<!--Post: 7733--><!--Time: 1108667592-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7733"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Itty<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Itty<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 11:13 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I forgot, I posted the map with the numbered locations and key on amw, user chickenlips6 <BR> <BR><a href="http://forums.prospero.com/foxamw/messages/?msg=1616.1" target=_top>http://forums.prospero.com/foxamw/messages/?msg=16 16.1</a> <BR> <BR>Have a looksy<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 7733-->
<!--Post: 7777--><!--Time: 1108678950-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST7777"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Maxgravis<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Maxgravis<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, February 17, 2005 - 2:22 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Itty, I don&#39;t see how the K leg can be involved with the B, the K is further east of the B, the leg of the K might be that road that runs NW by SE. Or are you saying the B and the K are together? Looks like the K is formed from 10, 11, 12, 13 and 14. The t could be the highway intersection. Or maybe , he lives down that road, near the K somewhere. We&#39;ll see someday. I bet he will like to talk to reporters while he is in prison. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
